step 27 "@pulse until 600 is DEAD!!"
pulses 102
out god "\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice wounds the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch mauls Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rDecimus's slice injures the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch mauls Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rYou hear the goblin's death cry.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out dec "\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice wounds the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch mauls you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rYou have become better at sword!\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<18hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<18hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the goblin's attack.\n\rYour slice injures the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<18hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<18hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch mauls you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<10hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the goblin's attack.\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<10hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rYour slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 11 experience points.\n\rYou hear the goblin's death cry.\n\r\n\r<7hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
